ems are common in fast-growing cities.","Interesting. Such problems are rare in fast-growing cities.","Interesting. These problems are common in big cities."],"a":0,"en":1,"why":"Nghe such problems are common."},{"k":"natural","o":["Such a approach is risky.","Such an approach is risky."],"a":1}],"words":[{"id":"former","ipa":"ˈfɔɹmɚ","vi":"cựu; trước đây; cái trước","level":2},{"id":"latter","ipa":"ˈlætɚ","vi":"cái sau; người sau; phần sau","level":1},{"id":"respectively","ipa":"ɹɪˈspɛktɪvli","vi":"lần lượt; theo thứ tự tương ứng","level":4},{"id":"trend","ipa":"tɹɛnd","vi":"xu hướng; khuynh hướng","level":2},{"id":"rely","ipa":"ɹɪˈlaɪ","vi":"dựa vào; trông cậy; tin cậy","level":2},{"id":"conclusion","ipa":"kənˈkluʒən","vi":"kết luận; phần kết; sự kết thúc","level":2}],"audio":{"src":"/audio/grammar/cohesion-reference.mp3","v":"eef865ede8","duration":189.192,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}